{"zh":[{"start":0.0,"end":7.27,"text":"4、3、2、1，亚特兰蒂斯号航天飞机升空，这是最后一次"},{"start":7.27,"end":11.11,"text":"去提升哈勃的视力，让它看清宇宙最深处的壮丽"},{"start":11.11,"end":13.68,"text":"——我们的宇宙！"},{"start":36.57,"end":39.44,"text":"哈勃给我们出了几道难题，但我觉得这真的"},{"start":39.44,"end":43.78,"text":"证明了整个团队，这里船上的，亚特兰蒂斯号上的，"},{"start":43.78,"end":48.78,"text":"当然还有地面上的戈达德团队，"},{"start":48.78,"end":52.79,"text":"我们克服了这些困难，现在望远镜里装上了"},{"start":52.79,"end":55.79,"text":"第三代广域相机，它将帮助揭开"},{"start":55.79,"end":56.96,"text":"宇宙的秘密。"},{"start":121.09,"end":124.96,"text":"欢迎回家，亚特兰蒂斯号，祝贺你们圆满完成"},{"start":124.96,"end":129.23,"text":"这次任务，给哈勃换上了一双新眼睛，"},{"start":129.23,"end":141.84,"text":"它将继续扩展我们对宇宙的认识！"}],"de":[],"en":[{"start":0.0,"end":7.27,"text":"4, 3, 2, 1, liftoff of Space Shuttle Atlantis, and the final","words":[["4,","4"],["3,","3"],["2,","2"],["1,","1"],["liftoff","升空"],["of","的"],["Space","航天"],["Shuttle","飞机"],["Atlantis,","亚特兰蒂斯"],["and","和"],["the","这"],["final","最后"]]},{"start":7.27,"end":11.11,"text":"visit to enhance the vision of Hubble into the deepest grandeur","words":[["visit","访问"],["to","去"],["enhance","提升"],["the","这"],["vision","视力"],["of","的"],["Hubble","哈勃"],["into","进入"],["the","这"],["deepest","最深的"],["grandeur","壮丽"]]},{"start":11.11,"end":13.68,"text":"of our universe!","words":[["of","的"],["our","我们的"],["universe!","宇宙"]]},{"start":36.57,"end":39.44,"text":"Hubble threw us a few curves, but I think it's really","words":[["Hubble","哈勃"],["threw","扔"],["us","我们"],["a","几个"],["few","一些"],["curves,","曲线球"],["but","但"],["I","我"],["think","认为"],["it's","它是"],["really","真的"]]},{"start":39.44,"end":43.78,"text":"a testament to the whole team, onboard here, onboard the","words":[["a","一个"],["testament","证明"],["to","对"],["the","这"],["whole","整个"],["team,","团队"],["onboard","在船上"],["here,","这里"],["onboard","在船上"],["the","这"]]},{"start":43.78,"end":48.78,"text":"Atlantis, and of course on the ground. The Goddard team, that","words":[["Atlantis,","亚特兰蒂斯"],["and","和"],["of","当"],["course","然"],["on","在"],["the","这"],["ground.","地面"],["The","这"],["Goddard","戈达德"],["team,","团队"],["that","那"]]},{"start":48.78,"end":52.79,"text":"we were able to overcome them, and we have a Wide Field Camera","words":[["we","我们"],["were","是"],["able","能够"],["to","去"],["overcome","克服"],["them,","它们"],["and","而"],["we","我们"],["have","有"],["a","一个"],["Wide","广"],["Field","视场"],["Camera","相机"]]},{"start":52.79,"end":55.79,"text":"3 in the telescope which will help to unlock the secrets of","words":[["3","3"],["in","在"],["the","这"],["telescope","望远镜"],["which","它"],["will","将"],["help","帮助"],["to","去"],["unlock","揭开"],["the","这"],["secrets","秘密"],["of","的"]]},{"start":55.79,"end":56.96,"text":"the universe.","words":[["the","这"],["universe.","宇宙"]]},{"start":121.09,"end":124.96,"text":"Welcome home Atlantis, congratulations on a very","words":[["Welcome","欢迎"],["home","回家"],["Atlantis,","亚特兰蒂斯"],["congratulations","祝贺"],["on","在"],["a","一次"],["very","非常"]]},{"start":124.96,"end":129.23,"text":"successful mission, giving Hubble a new set of eyes that","words":[["successful","成功的"],["mission,","任务"],["giving","给"],["Hubble","哈勃"],["a","一"],["new","新"],["set","套"],["of","的"],["eyes","眼睛"],["that","它"]]},{"start":129.23,"end":141.84,"text":"will continue to expand our knowledge of the universe!","words":[["will","将"],["continue","继续"],["to","去"],["expand","扩展"],["our","我们的"],["knowledge","知识"],["of","的"],["the","这"],["universe!","宇宙"]]}]}